{"title": "Deathbringer's Legacy", "pageid": 31891, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Deathbringer's_Legacy", "categories": ["Class actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Rage.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b8/Rage.webp/300px-Rage.webp, /w/images/b/b8/Rage.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b8/Rage.webp/300px-Rage.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b8/Rage.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Deathbringer's Legacy</b> is a free action used by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sarevok_Anchev\" title=\"Sarevok Anchev\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png/25px-Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png/38px-Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png/50px-Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sarevok Anchev\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png/25px-Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/df/Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sarevok_Anchev\" title=\"Sarevok Anchev\">Sarevok Anchev</a>. After gaining 4 <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Murderous_Strikes_(Condition)\" title=\"Murderous Strikes (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Murderous Strikes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Murderous_Strikes_(Condition)\" title=\"Murderous Strikes (Condition)\">Murderous Strikes</a>, he can enter an enraged state to unleash a devastating <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer_Assault\" title=\"Deathbringer Assault\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Deathbringer Assault\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer_Assault\" title=\"Deathbringer Assault\">Deathbringer Assault</a>. This action is triggered automatically once Sarevok gains the prerequisite Murderous Strikes.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Sarevok can use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer_Assault\" title=\"Deathbringer Assault\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Deathbringer Assault\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer_Assault\" title=\"Deathbringer Assault\">Deathbringer Assault</a> until the end of his next turn. \n</p>\nHe temporarly loses the Absorbed Essences of <a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_Sendai\" title=\"Echo of Sendai\">Sendai</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_Illasera\" title=\"Echo of Illasera\">Illasera</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_Amelyssan\" title=\"Echo of Amelyssan\">Amelyssan</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_Abazigal\" title=\"Echo of Abazigal\">Abazigal</a> if active, regaining them at the end of his next turn.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Self</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UIDs</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_LOW_MurderTribunal_DeathbringerLegacy</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_LOW_MurderTribunal_DeathbringerLegacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_LOW_MurderTribunal_DeathbringerLegacy\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span> Version used by the AI on Sarevok's turn</div><code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_LOW_MurderTribunal_DeathbringerLegacy_OutsideOwnTurn</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_LOW_MurderTribunal_DeathbringerLegacy_OutsideOwnTurn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_LOW_MurderTribunal_DeathbringerLegacy_OutsideOwnTurn\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span> Version triggered automatically through scripts</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\"> Grants: </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer_Assault\" title=\"Deathbringer Assault\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/80px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Deathbringer Assault\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer_Assault\" title=\"Deathbringer Assault\">Deathbringer Assault</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span id=\"Condition:_Deathbringer.27s_Legacy\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Deathbringer's_Legacy\"> Condition: Deathbringer's Legacy </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer%27s_Legacy_(Condition)\" title=\"Deathbringer's Legacy (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/ima